<title>UK: Trading suspended in Scottish Pride shares.</title>
<headline>Trading suspended in Scottish Pride shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share trading in processor and distributor of milk and associated products Scottish Pride Holdings Plc was suspended on Thursday pending a clarification of the company's financial position.</p>
<p>The firm's shares, traded on AIM, closed at 42-1/2 pence on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The suspension was made on the request of the company which said a further announcement would be made shortly.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
